<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 10 WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 10 WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat</p>
<p>Australia by 10 wickets on the third day of the fifth and final</p>
<p>test at the WACA on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 and 194. West Indies 384 and</p>
<p>57-0.</p>
</text>
